{"id":12971,"date":"2025-09-03T10:07:19","date_gmt":"2025-09-03T10:07:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?p=12971"},"modified":"2025-09-23T10:12:06","modified_gmt":"2025-09-23T10:12:06","slug":"nurturing-potential-expanding-opportunity-aims-ghana-welcomes-the-class-of-2025-26","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/nurturing-potential-expanding-opportunity-aims-ghana-welcomes-the-class-of-2025-26\/","title":{"rendered":"Nurturing Potential, Expanding Opportunity \u2013 AIMS Ghana Welcomes the Class of 2025\/26"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>AIMS Ghana proudly welcomed the Class of 2025\/26 this August, a dynamic cohort of 50 students representing 19 African countries. These bright young minds for the next year, will be embarking on a transformative academic journey in the mathematical sciences at AIMS Ghana\u2019s Centre of Excellence in Accra.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The new intake reflects AIMS\u2019 mission to nurture Africa\u2019s next generation of problem-solvers, innovators, and scientific leaders. Over the coming year, students will be immersed in world-class training, collaborative research, and leadership development, equipping them to tackle some of the continent\u2019s and the world\u2019s most pressing challenges.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-1 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"961\" height=\"655\" data-id=\"12974\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/09\/Screenshot-2025-09-23-100400.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12974\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1156\" height=\"967\" data-id=\"12975\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/09\/Screenshot-2025-09-23-094825-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12975\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"904\" height=\"625\" data-id=\"12973\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/09\/Screenshot-2025-09-23-100335.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12973\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>AIMS Ghana remains committed to ensuring that the Class of 2025\/26 has a wholesome and impactful experience, combining rigorous academics with mentorship, community engagement, and opportunities to connect with global partners in science and industry.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As the journey begins, our Centre celebrates this milestone with the certainty that these students will go on to shape the future of science, technology and innovation across Africa.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>AIMS Ghana proudly welcomed the Class of 2025\/26 this August, a dynamic cohort of 50 students representing 19 African countries. These bright young minds for the next year, will be embarking on a transformative academic journey in the mathematical sciences at AIMS Ghana\u2019s Centre of Excellence in Accra. The new intake reflects AIMS\u2019 mission to<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":17,"featured_media":12976,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":""},"categories":[2],"tags":[],"news_types":[32],"acf":[],"author_meta":{"display_name":"seyram","author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/seyram\/"},"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/09\/Screenshot-2025-09-23-100626.png","coauthors":[],"tax_additional":{"categories":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/category\/featured\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Featured<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Featured<\/span>"]}},"comment_count":"0","relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 3 months ago","modified":"Updated 2 months ago"},"ab